ing. There is no indication of any problem with a snowmobile.\n\n---\n\n**Temporal Sequence Note:**  \nThe frames appear to capture the aftermath of a hunt — the man is shown aiming, then holding the bird, and later speaking to the camera. There is no transition or sequence that shows the family returning to or interacting with a snowmobile after the hunt. The distant vehicle in Frame 23–25 is not shown to be involved in any problem or malfunction.\n\n---\n\n**Conclusion:**  \nThere is **no visual evidence** in any of the 30 frames to support the claim that “their snowmobile can’t reverse.” The snowmobile is either not present, not shown with riders, or not depicted as having any mechanical issues. The focus of the frames is on the hunting activity and the vlogger’s reaction to it.\n\n✅ Therefore, **answer ‘4’ is incorrect** based on the provided frames."}, {'batch_start': 270, 'batch_end': 300, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KbahC-QCKU8/frames/frame_1705.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KbahC-QCKU8/frames/frame_1706.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KbahC-QCKU8/frames/frame_1707.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KbahC-QCKU8/frames/frame_1708.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KbahC-QCKU8/frames/frame_1709.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KbahC-QCKU8/frames/frame_1710.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KbahC-QCKU8/frames/frame_1711.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KbahC-QCKU8/frames/frame_1712.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KbahC-QCKU8/frames/frame_1713.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KbahC-QCKU8/frames/frame_1714.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KbahC-QCKU8/frames/frame_1715.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KbahC-QCKU8/frames/frame_1716.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KbahC-QCKU8/frames/frame_1717.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KbahC-QCKU8/frames/frame_1718.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/d